[
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-01",
    "role": "opening",
    "config": {
      "text": "A red face.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "A very long nose.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Wings on the back, and a fan of feathers in one hand.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "This is the tengu, the mountain goblin of Japanese legend.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Its name is written with two characters that mean \"heavenly dog.\" Yet the tengu we know looks nothing like a dog.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "And in the oldest Japanese record, the tengu is not a creature of the mountains at all.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-07",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It is something in the sky.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P02-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In this episode, we follow the tengu from a court chronicle of the year 720, through medieval tales, to the masks, carvings, and printed books of later centuries.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The Nihon Shoki, the Chronicles of Japan, was completed in 720.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12,
      "phonemes": "ðə nˈiːhɑːn ʃˈoʊki , ðə kɹˈɑːnɪkəlz ʌv dʒəpˈæn, wʌz kəmplˈiːɾᵻd ɪn sˈɛvənhˈʌndɹɪd twˈɛnti."
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Its entry for the year 637 records a strange event.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "A great star flowed across the sky from east to west, with a sound like thunder.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Some people said it was the sound of a falling star.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Others said it was thunder from the earth.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Then a Buddhist monk named Bin, who had studied in China, gave a different answer.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It is not a falling star, he said.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It is a tengu, a celestial dog, and the sound of its barking is like thunder.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "This is thought to be the first time the word appears in a Japanese record.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Bin was drawing on Chinese learning.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the Records of the Grand Historian, written in China more than two thousand years ago, the heavenly dog is a kind of star.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It looks like a great shooting star, it makes a sound, and where it comes down to earth, it looks like a dog.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Today, we might call such a sight a fireball, a very bright meteor.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In one old copy of the chronicle, a small reading note beside the word calls it a heavenly fox.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "After this, the word almost disappears from the records for several centuries.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "When the tengu returns, it has changed.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the Konjaku Monogatari, a great collection of tales from the twelfth century, tengu deceive people, and try to lead Buddhist monks away from their practice.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12,
      "phonemes": "ɪnðə kɑːndʒˈɑːkuː moʊnoʊɡɑːtˈɑːɹi , ɐ ɡɹˈeɪt kəlˈɛkʃən ʌv tˈeɪlz fɹʌmðə twˈɛlfθ sˈɛntʃɚɹi, tˈɛŋɡuː dᵻsˈiːv pˈiːpəl, ænd tɹˈaɪ tə lˈiːd bˈuːdɪst mˈʌŋks ɐwˈeɪ fɹʌm ðɛɹ pɹˈæktɪs."
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "They are proud and clever, and in the end, they are usually defeated.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In one tale, a Buddha appears in the branches of a persimmon tree in the capital, shining and scattering flowers.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Crowds come to worship.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "But one minister has his doubts, and he simply keeps staring.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "At last the Buddha vanishes, and a great kite with a broken wing falls from the tree.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The tengu was a bird all along.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In another tale, a tengu from China crosses the sea to test the monks of Japan, and is badly beaten by the young attendants who guard them.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Picture scrolls of the 1200s and 1300s retold such stories, and many of their tengu have the beaks and wings of birds of prey.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The Tengu Zōshi, from around 1296, even shows proud monks as tengu, as a warning against pride.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "This bird-faced form lives on today as the karasu tengu, the \"crow tengu.\"",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Over time, another kind of tengu became familiar: a red face, a long nose, and the dress of a yamabushi, one of the mountain ascetics of Japan, with a fan of feathers.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12,
      "phonemes": "ˌoʊvɚ tˈaɪm, ɐnˈʌðɚ kˈaɪnd ʌv tˈɛŋɡuː bɪkˌeɪm fəmˈɪlɪɹ: ɐ ɹˈɛd fˈeɪs, ɐ lˈɔŋ nˈoʊz, ænd ðə dɹˈɛs əvə jɑːmɑːbˈuːʃi , wˈʌn ʌvðə mˈaʊntɪn ɐsˈɛɾɪks ʌv dʒəpˈæn, wɪð ɐ fˈæn ʌv fˈɛðɚz."
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Exactly when the long nose first appeared is not clear.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "This mask, made for a suit of armor in the early 1700s, already gives the tengu a long, jutting nose.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Mount Kurama, north of Kyoto, became famous for its great tengu.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12,
      "phonemes": "mˈaʊnt kˈuːɹɑːmɑː , nˈɔːɹθ ʌv kjˈoʊtoʊ , bɪkˌeɪm fˈeɪməs fɔːɹ ɪts ɡɹˈeɪt tˈɛŋɡuː."
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "A Noh play, Kurama Tengu, tells how the young Minamoto no Yoshitsune, then called Ushiwakamaru, learned the arts of war from the great tengu of the mountain.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12,
      "phonemes": "ɐ nˈoʊ plˈeɪ, kˈuːɹɑːmɑː tˈɛŋɡuː, tˈɛlz hˌaʊ ðə jˈʌŋ miːnɑːmˈoʊtoʊ noʊ joʊʃˈiːtsuːneɪ , ðˈɛn kˈɔːld uːʃiːwɑːkɑːmˈɑːɹuː , lˈɜːnd ðɪ ˈɑːɹts ʌv wˈɔːɹ fɹʌmðə ɡɹˈeɪt tˈɛŋɡuː ʌvðə mˈaʊntɪn."
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Edo-period artists returned to this scene again and again, in prints and in small carvings like this one.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "And the bird never went away.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In this book of sketches by Hokusai, the figure labeled \"tengu\" is still a great bird.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12,
      "phonemes": "ɪn ðɪs bˈʊk ʌv skˈɛtʃᵻz bˈaɪ hˈoʊkuːsaɪ , ðə fˈɪɡjɚ lˈeɪbəld \"tˈɛŋɡuː\" ɪz stˈɪl ɐ ɡɹˈeɪt bˈɜːd."
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "For centuries, long-nosed tengu and bird-faced tengu lived side by side.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Over time, tengu also became guardians.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "At some mountain temples and shrines, they are still honored as protectors of the mountain today.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-01",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "So what was the first tengu?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the oldest record, it is a star that roared across the sky.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In medieval tales, it is a bird that deceives and tests the faithful.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The long-nosed figure came later, and joined the bird rather than replacing it.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-01",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "The tengu we picture today is not the oldest part of the legend.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-02",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "It is one of the newest.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-03",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "Every story has an origin.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-04",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "Sometimes, it begins in the sky.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P15-01",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "This video is based on historical texts and public museum collections.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P15-02",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "The narration uses synthetic speech, and some images are AI-generated reconstructions.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P15-03",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "Sources and terms of use are listed in the description.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P15-04",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "If you enjoyed this story, please like the video and subscribe for more quiet origins.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
